# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# Dependencies
node_modules
.pnp
.pnp.js
# pnpm's local content-addressable store. A reviewer running `pnpm install`
# with a repo-local store would otherwise offer thousands of package files as
# untracked changes. Ignoring it does NOT delete anyone's store.
.pnpm-store/

# Local env files
.env
.env.local
.env.production
# Local review/integration connection config. Contains throwaway local
# credentials for the disposable `kazhal-review` PostgreSQL and must never
# be committed. See docs/REVIEW-DATABASE.md.
.env.*.local
.env.review.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local

